  "mathematical_review": "ENTIRE 624-line frozen source, all private helpers and public results, projection definition and all FIVE complete written BP proofs reviewed. Literal coefficient truncation of arbitrary finite span representations proves exact shifted maximal-power coefficients for genuinely homogeneous generators, with natural subtraction handling zero/small orders and empty families. The actual pivot-zero algebra retraction has its literal whole coefficient formula, idempotence, exact variable-divisibility kernel, preservation of EVERY actual maximal power and true one-variable coefficient-shift reflection. For an actual whole finite ideal with exceptional cancellation, true generator powers and homogeneous pivot shadows, finite induction on q projects to homogeneous fibres, lifts the high-order fibre expression, divides the actual zero-projection difference by the pivot, uses whole exceptional saturation, and applies induction to the SAME generators. It gives exact whole shifted filtered division without a completed standardness input. A separate explicit decomposition of pivot times F into ideal plus maximal power and the same actual projected homogeneous lifting proves EVERY whole colon identity (I+m^(q+1)):x_e=I+m^q. The original-only point endpoint fixes ONE analytic normalized canonical reduced-vertex family from J/j/b BEFORE all current-order hypotheses and jets. Literal original generator division, actual total saturation and analytic exceptional cancellation identify its whole span with the independently defined normalized ideal. Genuine Taylor-flat finite analytic syzygy generation transports this actual analytic exceptional cancellation to the WHOLE formal extension. Exact actual quotient pure coefficients equal those of the original degree-d homogeneous polynomial after literal point dehomogenization; that polynomial is pivot-independent and degree at most d. The natural retained current order of the SAME H eliminates all lower degrees, proving the genuinely homogeneous pivot shadow internally. Thus the same H gives both exact whole filtered division and every exceptional initial-symbol colon identity after ALL its original vertex-order bounds. No target filtered division, homogeneous-shadow, exceptional regularity, fixed-coordinate diagram inclusion or HS certificate is supplied at the original endpoint.",
